Adaptation_method:
Replace subprocess.cancel() with subprocess.kill():

```diff
- subprocess.cancel();
+ subprocess.kill();
```

Or use the cancelSignal option with an AbortController:

```js
const abortController = new AbortController();
const subprocess = execa('node', ['file.js'], {cancelSignal: abortController.signal});
// Later when you want to cancel:
abortController.abort();
```
